  "step_by_step_reasoning": "The architecture diagram represents MakeMyTrip's Next-Gen SOC setup. On the left, log sources originate from AWS (VPC) and On-Premises (OnPremDC), flowing into Apache Metron (EC2). From Apache Metron, data flows down into the Security Data Lake, passing to EMR, then to S3 storage, and querying via Athena. A feedback arrow goes from S3/Security Data Lake back into Apache Metron for continuous model enrichment. For incident response, Apache Metron sends alerts to a SOAR platform (EC2), which alerts the SOC Analyst (UserCompanyAnalyst), who can trigger mitigation via AWS WAF.",
